---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, mailto } from '../lib/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title={`Contact — ${SITE.name}`}
  description="Reach Jay McDaniel by email about a valuation, a business divorce or ownership dispute, or an exit — or schedule a strategy call."
  current="contact"
>
  <div class="page-wrap">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="sub">The fastest way to a specific answer</p>

    <p>The questions worth asking are usually specific &mdash; a valuation problem, a dispute over who owns what and what it is worth, an exit, a provision in an agreement. Email is the best way to put one in front of me. I read every message.</p>

    <div class="endsub" style="margin-top:26px">
      <h3>Email me</h3>
      <p>Write to <a class="email-inline" href={mailto()}>{SITE.email}</a>, or use the button, and tell me plainly what you are dealing with.</p>
      <a class="email-cta" href={mailto()}>Email me</a>
    </div>

    <p style="margin-top:26px">Prefer to talk it through? <a href={SITE.bookingUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Schedule a strategy call &rarr;</a></p>

    <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer video? The same questions get short breakdowns on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@CloselyHeld">@CloselyHeld</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
